Hul
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 94 DEAL OYI
OYI 1 FACE_HALF
OYI 2 FACE_HALF
OYI 7 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE OYI OYI
DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE_STACK OYI OYI
SRCSTACK Size < 6
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Empty
$win
OR
    PILE ALL OYI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL OYI Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
